**Ecosystem:** {% for skill in skills.ecosystem %}{{ skill }}{% if not loop.last %} • {% endif %}{% endfor %}

**Experienced:** {% for skill in skills.experienced %}{{ skill }}{% if not loop.last %} • {% endif %}{% endfor %}

